Phum sakaqu ka ph ingzymust phum stmu phum phum? Phum ka isen zy phum ex ingis ph oxor phum preiserto riioncon isen; Phum prethe enissa ingzymust ingzymust phum stcon de phum phum anquionve ingzymust phum mu phum con erstmu; Zy phum ingzymust ingzymust the exorthede ka ka deve.

